{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Cookie Policy | Ask the Expat Girls{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <section class="legal-container">

        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

        <p><strong>Last updated: September 2026</strong></p>

        <p>At <strong>Ask the Expat Girls</strong>, we use cookies and similar technologies
            to ensure that our website functions properly and, where applicable, to understand
            how visitors use our website and improve our services.</p>

        <p>This Cookie Policy explains what cookies are, how we may use them and how you can
            manage your cookie preferences.</p>


        {# ============================================================
       1. WHAT ARE COOKIES?
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container1">
            <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
            <p>Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device when you visit a website.</p>
            <p>They allow a website to recognize your device and remember certain information about your visit or preferences.</p>
            <p>Cookies may be used for different purposes, including website functionality,
                security, analytics and advertising.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       2. HOW WE USE COOKIES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container2">
            <h2>2. How we use cookies</h2>
            <p>Our website may use cookies and similar technologies for the following purposes:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>To ensure that the website functions properly;</li>

                <li>To provide authentication and security features;</li>

                <li>To remember certain preferences where applicable;</li>

                <li>To understand how visitors use our website;</li>

                <li>To improve the performance and functionality of our website;</li>

                <li>To support analytics or advertising activities where applicable and
                    where your consent is required.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       3. NECESSARY COOKIES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container3">
            <h2>3. Necessary cookies</h2>
            <p>Some cookies may be necessary for the website to function properly.</p>
            <p>These cookies may be required for essential functions such as:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Authentication;</li>
                <li>Account access;</li>
                <li>Website security;</li>
                <li>Session management;</li>
                <li>Other essential website functionality.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Because these cookies may be necessary for the operation and security of the
                website, they may not require consent where permitted by applicable law.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       4. ANALYTICS COOKIES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container4">
            <h2>4. Analytics cookies</h2>

            <p>We may use analytics cookies or similar technologies to help us understand
                how visitors use our website.</p>

            <p>Analytics information may help us understand, for example, which pages are
                visited, how visitors interact with the website and how the website performs.</p>

            <p>Analytics cookies will only be used where applicable consent has been obtained,
                unless an applicable legal exception allows their use without consent.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       5. ADVERTISING COOKIES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container5">
            <h2>5. Advertising cookies</h2>
            <p>If advertising technologies are used on our website, advertising cookies or
                similar technologies may be used to provide, measure or improve advertising
                activities.</p>

            <p>Such cookies will require your consent where required by applicable law.</p>

            <p>We will provide information about relevant advertising technologies and
                third-party providers where they are used on the website.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       6. THIRD-PARTY COOKIES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container6">
            <h2>6. Third-party cookies</h2>

            <p>Some cookies may be placed by third-party service providers whose services
                are used on our website.</p>

            <p>Depending on the services implemented on the website, these providers may
                process information collected through cookies or similar technologies.</p>

            <p>We will update this Cookie Policy where necessary to identify relevant
                third-party services and explain their purposes.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       7. YOUR COOKIE PREFERENCES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container7">
            <h2>7. Your cookie preferences</h2>
            <p>Where cookies require your consent, you can choose whether to accept or
                refuse those cookies through the cookie consent mechanism provided on our website.</p>

            <p>You may also be able to change your preferences later, depending on the
                cookie management tools available on the website.</p>

            <p>Refusing certain cookies may affect some features or functionality of the website.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       8. BROWSER SETTINGS
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container8">
            <h2>8. Managing cookies through your browser</h2>
            <p>Most web browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings.</p>
            <p>You can generally configure your browser to block, delete or restrict cookies.</p>
            <p>Please note that disabling certain cookies may affect the functionality
                of our website, particularly cookies that are necessary for authentication,
                security or other essential functions.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       9. DATA COLLECTED THROUGH COOKIES
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container9">
            <h2>9. Personal data collected through cookies</h2>
            <p>Depending on the cookies and technologies used on the website, information
                collected may include technical information about your device, browser,
                website interactions or preferences.</p>

            <p>Where information collected through cookies constitutes personal data,
                it will be processed in accordance with our <strong>Privacy Policy</strong>.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       10. LEGAL BASIS
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container10">
            <h2>10. Legal basis</h2>

            <p>Where consent is required under applicable data protection and electronic communications
                laws, we will obtain your consent before placing or using the relevant cookies.</p>

            <p>Cookies that are strictly necessary for the operation, security or authentication of the website
                may be used where permitted by applicable law without obtaining prior consent.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       11. RETENTION
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container11">
            <h2>11. How long cookies are kept</h2>
            <p>Cookies may be either session cookies or persistent cookies.</p>
            <p>Session cookies are generally deleted when you close your browser.</p>
            <p>Persistent cookies remain on your device for a defined period or until they are deleted manually.</p>
            <p>The retention period depends on the purpose and configuration of each cookie.
                We aim to ensure that cookies are not retained for longer than necessary.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       12. CHANGES TO THIS COOKIE POLICY
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container12">
            <h2>12. Changes to this Cookie Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time to reflect changes to the cookies
                and technologies used on our website, changes to our services, or changes to applicable laws.</p>

            <p>When we make changes, we will update the
                <strong>"Last updated"</strong>
                date at the top of this page.</p>
        </section>


        {# ============================================================
       13. PRIVACY POLICY
       ============================================================ #}

        <section class="legal-container13">
            <h2>13. More information about your personal data</h2>
            <p>For more information about how we collect, use, store and protect your
                personal information, please see our
                <a href="{{ path('app_privacy_policy') }}">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        </section>


